  "sn7.18:4.1": "",
  "sn7.18:4.2": "The brahmin takes <i lang='pi' translate='no'>tidiva</i> as the Brahmā realm rather than that of Indra (see note on <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn3.21/en/sujato#15.5'>SN 3.21:15.5</a>). ",
  "sn7.18:4.3": "",
  "sn7.18:4.4": "",
  "sn7.18:5.1": "",
  "sn7.18:5.2": "Here <i lang='pi' translate='no'>dhātu</i> means <i lang='pi' translate='no'>loka</i> (“realm”), not “element”. ",
  "sn7.18:5.3": "",
  "sn7.18:5.4": "The Buddha rejects the brahmin’s supposition (see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn26/en/sujato#15.35'>MN 26:15.35</a> and note). ",
